WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:07.480
Introducing yourself. Say your name, ask someone theirs, and say where you are from.

2
00:00:09.230 --> 00:00:15.150
To say your name, use Mam na imię followed by your first name.

3
00:00:15.500 --> 00:00:22.060
To say where you are from, use Jestem z followed by the name of the country.

4
00:00:22.410 --> 00:00:30.850
The country name changes its ending after z, so for now it is best to learn these sentences as whole phrases.

5
00:00:32.600 --> 00:00:35.000
Mam na imię Anna.

6
00:00:36.200 --> 00:00:38.600
Mam na imię Anna.

7
00:00:39.000 --> 00:00:41.680
It means: My name is Anna.

8
00:00:43.430 --> 00:00:44.950
Jak masz na imię?

9
00:00:46.150 --> 00:00:47.670
Jak masz na imię?

10
00:00:48.070 --> 00:00:50.710
It means: What is your name?

11
00:00:51.060 --> 00:00:56.100
Informal. Speaking to one person you know well, or a child.

12
00:00:57.850 --> 00:00:59.690
Jestem z Polski.

13
00:01:00.890 --> 00:01:02.730
Jestem z Polski.

14
00:01:03.130 --> 00:01:06.050
It means: I am from Poland.

15
00:01:07.800 --> 00:01:09.960
Jestem z Hiszpanii.

16
00:01:11.160 --> 00:01:13.320
Jestem z Hiszpanii.

17
00:01:13.720 --> 00:01:16.200
It means: I am from Spain.

18
00:01:17.950 --> 00:01:20.030
Miło mi cię poznać.

19
00:01:21.230 --> 00:01:23.310
Miło mi cię poznać.

20
00:01:23.710 --> 00:01:26.230
It means: Nice to meet you.

21
00:01:26.580 --> 00:01:35.220
Informal. A polite version uses pana (to a man) or panią (to a woman) instead of cię.

22
00:01:36.970 --> 00:01:39.690
Now listen to a short conversation.

23
00:01:40.040 --> 00:01:42.560
Cześć! Mam na imię Anna.

24
00:01:43.060 --> 00:01:45.300
Cześć! Jestem Piotr.

25
00:01:45.800 --> 00:01:47.880
Miło mi cię poznać.

26
00:01:48.380 --> 00:01:49.820
Mnie też.

27
00:01:51.720 --> 00:01:53.000
Let's recap.

28
00:01:53.350 --> 00:01:55.750
Mam na imię Anna.

29
00:01:56.350 --> 00:01:57.870
Jak masz na imię?

30
00:01:58.470 --> 00:02:00.310
Jestem z Polski.

31
00:02:00.910 --> 00:02:03.070
Jestem z Hiszpanii.

32
00:02:03.670 --> 00:02:05.750
Miło mi cię poznać.

33
00:02:07.750 --> 00:02:12.190
Now it's your turn. Practise with the exercises below the video.
